  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na-abịa Ịchị",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lee, ụbọchị",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na-abịa, mgbe a ga-ekesa ihe nkwata gị niile nʼetiti mgbidi gị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga m achịkọta mba niile ka ha bịa Jerusalem ibuso ya agha. Ha ga-adọta obodo ahụ nʼagha, tụtụkọọ ihe dị nʼụlọ niile, dinaa ndị inyom nʼike. A ga-adọta ọkara ndị bi nʼobodo ahụ nʼagha, duru ha gaa mba ọzọ. Ma ọkara nke ọzọ ka ha ga-ahapụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ahụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-apụ ibuso ndị mba ọzọ ahụ agha, dịka o si ebu agha nʼụbọchị agha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị ahụ, ụkwụ ya ga-eguzo nʼelu Ugwu Oliv, nke dị nʼọwụwa anyanwụ Jerusalem. Mgbe ahụ, Ugwu Oliv ga-ekewa abụọ, mee ka ndagwurugwu buru ibu dịrị site nʼọwụwa anyanwụ ruo nʼọdịda anyanwụ. Nʼihi ya, ugwu ahụ ga-eke onwe ya abụọ. Otu akụkụ ga-adị nʼugwu, nke ọzọ ga-adị nʼụzọ ndịda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu ga-esi na ndagwurugwu nke ugwu m ahụ gbalaga, nʼihi na ndagwurugwu ahụ ga-eru Azel. Unu ga-agbapụ dịka unu si gbapụ nʼoge gara aga, mgbe ala ọma jijiji ahụ, nʼoge Uzaya bụ eze Juda. Mgbe ahụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chineke m ga-abịa, ya na ndị nsọ ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị ahụ, ìhè anyanwụ agaghị adị, oyi agaghị adị, mkpụrụ mmiri agaghị adịkwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ ga-abụ ụbọchị pụrụ iche, ụbọchị ehihie na abalị na-agaghị adịkwa. Ọ bụ ụbọchị nke naanị",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maara. Ma ìhè ga-adịkwa nʼoge anyasị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị ahụ, mmiri na-enye ndụ ga-esi na Jerusalem na-asọpụta. Ọ ga-ekewa abụọ, ọkara ya ga-asọbanye nʼosimiri Nnu dị nʼihu anyanwụ ebe ọkara nke ọzọ ga-asọbanye nʼosimiri Mediterenịa dị nʼọdịda anyanwụ. Ha ga na-asọ nʼọkọchị na nʼudu mmiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-abụ eze nʼelu ụwa niile. Nʼụbọchị ahụ, naanị otu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-adị, naanị aha ya kwa ka a ga na-efe ofufe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala niile, site na Geba ruo Rimọn, nke dị na ndịda Jerusalem ga-adị ka ọzara. Ma ọ bụ naanị Jerusalem ga-adị nʼebe lara elu. Ọ ga-adịkwa nʼọnọdụ ya site nʼọnụ ụzọ ama nke Benjamin ruo nʼebe ọnụ ụzọ ama nke Mbụ, ruo nʼọnụ ụzọ ama nke dị nʼAkụkụ, sitekwa nʼỤlọ elu Hananel ruo nʼebe a na-azọchapụta mmanya eze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ga-ebiju na ya na-enweghị nsogbu. A gaghị emebikwa ya ọzọ. Jerusalem ga-ebikwa nʼudo na-atụghị egwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke a bụ ọrịa ọjọọ nke",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-eji kụda mba niile buru agha megide Jerusalem. Anụ ahụ ha ga-ere ure mgbe ha ka guzo ọtọ. Anya ha ga-erekwa ure, ire ha ga-erekwa ure nʼọnụ ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị ahụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-etinye ndị mmadụ oke ụjọ nʼobi. Oke ọgbaaghara ga-adị nʼetiti ha, ha ga-alụsokwa ibe ha ọgụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụladị Juda ga-ebu agha na Jerusalem. A ga-akwakọrọ akụ ndị mba ọzọ dị ha nso, bụ ọtụtụ ọlaedo na ọlaọcha, na uwe mara mma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọrịa ọjọọ dị otu a ga-adakwasị ịnyịnya niile, na ịnyịnya muul, na ịnyịnya kamel niile, na ịnyịnya ibu niile, na anụ niile dị nʼogige ndị agha ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ahụ, ndị fọdụrụ na mba niile ndị ahụ busoro Jerusalem agha, ga-abịa kwa afọ kpọọ isiala nye eze,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile ka ha soro mee mmemme ụlọ Ikwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụrụ na ndị ọbụla si na mba dị iche iche esoghị jee Jerusalem ife Eze ahụ, bụ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile, ha agaghị enwetakwa mmiri ozuzo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụrụ na ndị Ijipt ajụ ịga soro ndị ọzọ ife ofufe ahụ, ha agaghị enweta mmiri ozuzo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-eme ka ọrịa ọjọọ ahụ bịakwasị ha, dịka ọ siri bịakwasị mba ndị ahụ niile jụrụ iso mee mmemme ụlọ Ikwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke a ga-abụ ahụhụ dịrị ndị Ijipt, na ndị mba dị iche iche, ndị na-agaghị eso na mmemme ụlọ Ikwu ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼụbọchị ahụ, ihe a ga-ede nʼahụ ataṅụ nke ịnyịnya niile na-anya nʼolu ha bụ nke a: \"Ihe dị Nsọ nye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\" Ite niile e ji esi nri dị nʼụlọ nke",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-adị ka efere nsọ ndị ahụ dị nʼihu ebe ịchụ aja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ite niile dị na Juda, na nʼime Jerusalem ga-adị nsọ nye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.14.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile. Ndị niile bịara ịchụ aja ga-ewere ụfọdụ nʼime ite ndị a sie nri ịchụ aja ha. Nʼụbọchị ahụ kwa, a gaghị ahụ kwa ndị na-atụ mgbereahịa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "nʼụlọnsọ ukwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
